@startuml CLASS_05_SURAT_SERTIFIKAT
!theme plain
title Class Diagram - Surat Menyurat & Sertifikat

' ============================================
' SURAT MENYURAT
' ============================================
class Surat {
  # id : bigint
  --
  + from_lab_id : bigint {FK}
  + to_lab_id : bigint {FK}
  + sender_id : bigint {FK}
  + nomor_surat : string
  + perihal : string
  + isi_surat : text
  + lampiran : string
  + tanggal_kirim : datetime
  + is_read : bool
  + created_at : timestamp
  + updated_at : timestamp
  --
  + generateNomorSurat() : string
  + markAsRead() : void
  + isRead() : bool
  + hasAttachment() : bool
  + getAttachmentUrl() : string
  --
  {Relations}
  + fromLab() : BelongsTo
  + toLab() : BelongsTo
  + sender() : BelongsTo
}

' ============================================
' SERTIFIKAT
' ============================================
class Sertifikat {
  # id : bigint
  --
  + user_id : bigint {FK}
  + jenis_sertifikat : enum {praktikum, kepengurusan}
  + nomor_sertifikat : string
  + nama_kegiatan : string
  + tanggal_terbit : date
  + file_path : string
  + created_at : timestamp
  + updated_at : timestamp
  --
  + generateNomorSertifikat() : string
  + getDownloadUrl() : string
  + isValid() : bool
  {static} + validateNomor(nomor : string) : array
  --
  {Relations}
  + user() : BelongsTo
}

' ============================================
' RELATIONSHIPS
' ============================================

note top of Surat
  Inter-lab communication system.
  Features:
  - Auto-generate nomor surat
  - Attachment support
  - Read status tracking
  - Lab-to-lab messaging
end note

note bottom of Sertifikat
  Certificates for two types:
  1. praktikum: from praktikum completion
  2. kepengurusan: from kegiatan participation
  
  Nomor format: SERT/{lab}/{year}/{seq}
  
  Public validation available via
  static validateNomor() method.
end note

note right of Sertifikat
  Certificate Generation Flow:
  
  **For Praktikum:**
  1. Admin selects lulus praktikan
  2. Upload DOCX template
  3. System fills placeholders
  4. Generate per praktikan
  5. Save to sertifikat table
  
  **For Kegiatan:**
  1. Upload 2 templates (peserta/panitia)
  2. After kegiatan selesai
  3. Generate for all participants
  4. Save to both:
     - kegiatan_peserta table
     - sertifikat table
end note

note left of Surat
  Nomor Surat Format:
  {lab_code}/SRT/{seq}/{month}/{year}
  
  Example: DSI/SRT/001/02/2024
  
  Represents:
  - Lab: DSI
  - Type: SRT (Surat)
  - Sequence: 001
  - Month: 02
  - Year: 2024
end note

@enduml
